# Line endings are not negotiable here.
#
# Mahjong-Tournament-System.html at the root is a committed build output, and
# source/web/tests/built-file.test.js compares it byte for byte against a fresh build
# of source/web/src. If git rewrote line endings on checkout, that comparison would
# fail on Windows and pass on Linux for no reason anyone could see -- and the
# sources are inlined into the page, so converting them converts it too.
#
# So: LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# And the built page is never touched at all.
Mahjong-Tournament-System.html -text
